1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Želim da vam
kažem:

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:04,150
iako radimo
u mnogo zemalja

3
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:05,800
i do sada
smo završili

4
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,600
više od 400
projekata,

5
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:10,050
njih 50 smo
već završili

6
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:12,100
ovde u Srbiji,

7
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,450
tačnije
u Vojvodini.

8
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,700
A ako to gledate
kao procenat

9
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:19,100
od ukupnog broja

10
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,200
jevrejskih
zajednica

11
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:23,650
i grobalja
u nekoj zemlji,

12
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:25,900
to je najveći
procenat

13
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:28,300
zaštitnih radova
koji smo uradili

14
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,300
u bilo kojoj
zemlji.

